# through tools/sets.py). One line per format: the format, then its architectures; a format with none is not built.
#
# arm64 went first (2026110901): its package depended on a plugin-qualify the channel already served. The amd64 deb
# and the x86_64 rpm joined in 2026110902, once plugin-qualify 0.20.1 was in the channel. The aarch64 rpm joined in
